{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Once Upon A Mind: A Little Too Friendly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A short, story-driven psychological horror experience. With voice acting.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690750/extras/A_LITTLE_TOO_FRIENDLY.jpg?t=1745872269\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emily, 23, moves to Brooklyn in search of a fresh start her own space, her own life. The apartment is cozy, the landlady is kind, and the small caf\u00e9 around the corner offers her a quick job. Everything feels like it\u2019s falling into place\u2026 until it isn\u2019t.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLEASE USE\u00a0HEADPHONES\u00a0FOR\u00a0BETTER\u00a0EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Occasional Voice Acting</strong> \u2013 Every line of dialogue and monologue is now occasionally voiced, bringing the story's tension and emotions to life when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Grounded psychological horror</strong> \u2013 No ghosts. No monsters. Just people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Narrative-driven</strong> \u2013 Experience a chilling story told through dialogue, monologue, and immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690750/extras/TaxiDriver_Opening.gif?t=1745872269\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Short &amp; focused</strong> \u2013 Designed to be completed in under an hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Realistic tone</strong> \u2013 Inspired by real-life situations of obsession, control, and unease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>First-person exploration</strong> \u2013 Interact with your surroundings and uncover the story at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690750/extras/Trash_interaction.gif?t=1745872269\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Cozy Style Graphics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690750/extras/Nightscene.png?t=1745872269\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd39Calm caf\u00e9 gameplay \u2013 Experience gentle, peaceful moments during caf\u00e9 shifts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690750/extras/Coffee_CafeScene.gif?t=1745872269\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690750/extras/POSTER.jpg?t=1745872269\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690750?t=1745872269","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690750/a2bd1561564749ffb5bd48630a0b5f7d45d30bf3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745872269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690750/ca9f49a7d6222447a68c919a91b10666873a3f80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745872269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690750/ca9f49a7d6222447a68c919a91b10666873a3f80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745872269","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Once Upon A Mind: A Little Too Friendly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A short, story-driven psychological horror experience. With voice a